        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions TTLB-8.5  Lighting Bolt Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis amazing new designed door pull is constructed of 3/8\" thick, highest quality solid brass. Finished in your choice of Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, Polished Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Brass or Antique Brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou could use this pull handle on armoires, cabinet doors, drawers, sliding patio doors, storefront entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/lighting-bolt-shower-door-pulls-pair-first-impressions-sd-ttlb-8-5\"><b>Lighting Bolt Glass Shower Door Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions TTLB-8.5 Modern Lighting Bolt Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 6\" C/C (distance between the 2 mounting holes)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 6</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Lighting Bolt  door pull is hand crafted in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the drawer, door or cabinet).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually. (1 Pull Handle)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
