                "description": "First Impressions TTLB-8.5  Lighting Door Handles -- This amazing new designed door pull is constructed of 3/8 thick, highest quality solid brass. Finished in your choice of Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, Polished Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Brass or Antique Brass. Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the drawer, door or cabinet).",
